# ⚠️ Current Limitations

The project is currently focused on the machine learning pipeline.

The following components are still under development:

- REST API
- Docker Support
- Cloud Deployment
- Interactive Frontend
- Authentication
- Model Monitoring

The current implementation performs batch prediction only.

