# 🎯 Project Goal

The goal of ResponseGuard AI is to evolve from a high-performing NLP classification model into a complete end-to-end Machine Learning application that demonstrates the full deployment lifecycle—from data preprocessing and model development to API deployment and cloud-hosted inference.

